    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14691" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρᾰκος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰρ], ὁ,</span> a leguminous plant, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wild chickling, Lathyrus annuus,</i>
